# QA memory

Factory staff — **not** bound to a single `client_id`. Cross-client E2E / bulk / Opik.

- Ticket gate: `browser-e2e` (required before prod). Optional `bulk-api-probe` / `opik-eval` per tenant quality.yaml.
- Weekly: `qa-bulk-weekly` schedule → bulk (+ Opik) → New tickets on client projects.
- PM=`pm`, TA=`ta`, AA=`aa`. Mentions use Leantime user ids from MEMORY team table.
